  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile setup using scgpt encoder, comparing it to the scvi_n200 baseline (config_005). Validation accuracy of 0.5305 (F1: 0.5152) is lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501), suggesting scgpt may not improve performance in this configuration. The role of other factors like aggregation or profile-level features remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or multimodal setups."
